WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.453 --> 00:00:03.185
- [Gary] This is a just a rant,
very simple

00:00:03.185 --> 00:00:04.863
and something that 
I want you to pass on

00:00:04.863 --> 00:00:08.261
because the level of
complaining is unacceptable.

00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:11.608
Look. What if I told you
that you die this week?

00:00:11.608 --> 00:00:14.107
Would you complain 
about your crap job?

00:00:14.107 --> 00:00:17.308
I doubt it. You would go
much higher level thinking.

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:19.738
We're living in a world where
there's much more opportunity.

00:00:19.738 --> 00:00:23.593
I just don't get the mentality
of being head down sad.

00:00:23.593 --> 00:00:26.004
Please, take a 
step back and think about

00:00:26.004 --> 00:00:28.095
how awesome it actually is.

00:00:28.095 --> 00:00:30.907
And then, recognize that
you can attack the world

00:00:30.907 --> 00:00:33.102
in a totally different 
way because you are

00:00:33.102 --> 00:00:36.691
lucky enough to be 
born during this era.

00:00:36.691 --> 00:00:39.524
(dramatic music)

